aspx"},{"c":"NLY 2020 Q2","e":"nly","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"Also, as David mentioned, our internalization transaction closed at the end of the quarter, and we anticipate generating cost savings over the long-term as we embark on being an internally managed company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/annaly-capital-management-nly-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NLY 2020 Q3","e":"nly","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"…primarily due to lower average repo rate, lower compensation and G&A expenses as a result of cost savings from the company's internalization, as well as, record high TBA dollar roll income of $113 million in comparison to $96 million in the prior quarter due to higher average balances as we…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/annaly-capital-management-nly-q3-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2020 Q3","e":"nly","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"And 1.73% year-to-date, which is within the range of expected cost savings disclosed in Q1 with our internalization transaction announcement, even with the reduced equity base as a result of the March disruption and our share buyback program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/annaly-capital-management-nly-q3-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2020 Q4","e":"nly","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"We have also renegotiated our warehouse facilities to support our direct lending businesses proactively and have realized cost savings accordingly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/annaly-capital-management-nly-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2020 Q4","e":"nly","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"The 2020 annual opex results are within the range of expected cost savings disclosed in Q1 with our internalization transaction announcement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/annaly-capital-management-nly-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2021 Q1","e":"nly","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"Previously, we've provided a range of OPEX targets associated with potential cost savings from our internalization of 1.6% to 1.75%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/annaly-capital-management-nly-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2021 Q1","e":"nly","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"We expect to realize cost savings due to the disposition of our commercial real estate business, and began to see these in Q1 with an OPEX to equity ratio of 1.4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/annaly-capital-management-nly-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2021 Q3","e":"nly","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Finkelstein","x":"…Delta wave and related factors have led to a moderation in the economic recovery, labor market gains have slowed relative to the strong pace at the beginning of the summer, production bottlenecks and global supply chain disruptions have caused delays that raise prices on products and high demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/annaly-capital-management-nly-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2022 Q1","e":"nly","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"The recently announced disposition of our MML business should have an impact on expenses, as we ought to drive cost savings from this transaction in the long term and therefore expect to see an improvement in efficiency ratios in future periods.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/annaly-capital-management-nly-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2022 Q4","e":"nly","d":"2023-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"We ended the year with an opex-to-equity ratio of 1.4%, which is at the low end of the range discussed on previous earning calls, reflecting cost savings from the disposition of our MML and A creek businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/09/annaly-capital-management-nly-q4-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2023 Q1","e":"nly","d":"2023-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Serena Wolfe","x":"Our opex to equity ratio for the quarter was unchanged from full year 2022 at 1.4% as we've realized most of the cost savings from our internalization and divestiture of MML and ACREG businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/annaly-capital-management-nly-q1-2023-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2023 Q2","e":"nly","d":"2023-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Finkelstein","x":"With respect to the housing market, home prices continue to outperform expectations as we have now experienced five consecutive months of national home price increases according to Zillow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/27/annaly-capital-management-nly-q2-2023-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NLY 2025 Q2","e":"nly","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David L. Finkelstein","x":"Inflation, meanwhile, likely ran at the slowest level in the past three quarters, as the continued decline in service sector inflation offset firming and goods prices, some of which likely tariff related.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/annaly-nly-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NLY 2025 Q2","e":"nly","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David L. Finkelstein","x":"The economy and the labor market's resilience has affirmed the Fed's current wait-and-see stance with the majority of policymakers indicating a preference for more data to assess the impact of tariffs on inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/annaly-n